{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00780","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁郊祀乐章 庆肃 · 赵光逢、张衮","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁郊祀乐章 庆肃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笾豆簠簋，黍稷非馨。\n懿兹彝器，厥德惟明。\n金石匏革，以和以平。\n繇此无体，期乎永宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵光逢、张衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}